****Terraform state mngmt and backends****
Terraform state tracks your infrastructure, acting as a source of truth that maps your configuration code to real-world resources. .tfstate file maintains
terrfaorm refresh or terrform apply also refresh the .tfstate file
   terraform state list
   terraform state show aws_key_pair.my_key
   terraform state show aws_default_vpc.my_vpc
   terraform state rm aws_key_pair.my_key     - now terraform will not maintained the state for key pair
*** terraform import aws_key_pair.my_key < key-059e44ee6c77e7083b keyid from aws console>  then terraform apply - now terra will maintain the state 

